{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26037","headline":"玉山谣奉送王隐者 · 鲍溶","name":"玉山谣奉送王隐者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤皇城南玉山高，石脚耸立争雄豪。\n攒峯胎玉气色润，百泉透云流不尽。\n万古分明对眼开，五烟窈窕呈祥近。\n有客师事金身仙，用金买得山中田。\n闲开玉水灌芝草，静醉天酒松间眠。\n心期南溟万里外，出山几遇光阴改。\n水玉丁东不可闻，冰华皎洁应如待。\n秋风引吾歌去来，玉山彩翠遥相催。\n殷勤千树玉山顶，碧洞寥寥寒锦苔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26037.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26037","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}